1. **`eval_node_inv` (`ConcreteSpec/Proofs/Const.lean:46`)** — **REJECT (`approved: NO`)**: Exists only because `CExpr.nodeResult` is a copy-paste of `CExpr.eval`. Remove along with `CExpr.nodeResult`.
